WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:01.960
What a pity

00:02.480 --> 00:05.440
Should have been a good man serving my elder brother

00:05.520 --> 00:06.880
Go report to His Majesty quickly

00:06.960 --> 00:08.360
Miss Chen

00:09.320 --> 00:11.640
No need for Prince of Jin to remind me

00:11.720 --> 00:12.880
I'm leaving

